{"series":{"id":"deep-spaces-other-shore","slug":"deep-spaces-other-shore","title":"Deep Space's Other Shore","image":"https://donghualife.com/images/webp/deep-spaces-other-shore-1__coverImage.webp","synopsis":"Mientras surgen las nuevas artes marciales, que abogan por una cultivación basada en la tecnología, las artes marciales antiguas transmitidas durante milenios, caen gradualmente en el olvido. Wang Xuan, un joven prodigio del antiguo camino, se une inesperadamente a la misteriosa organización Camino Secreto.Tras arrebatar tesoros supremos, luchar contra los practicantes de las nuevas artes y enfrentarse a antiguos inmortales, logra vislumbrar el gran secreto que ocultan las antiguas artes marciales. Para hacer frente a la inminente y colosal crisis que se avecina, Wang Xuan no duda en adentrarse en las profundidades del espacio exterior, desafiando los límites de su propio poder.Estudio: Motion Magic (幻维数码)Autor: Chen Dong ( Perfect world / Shrouding the heavens / Immortal world / Tomb of fallen gods / sacred ruins)","genres":["Artes marciales","Cultivo","Acción","Fantasía"],"sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/series/deep-spaces-other-shore","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:37:04.419Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"deep-spaces-other-shore-1","slug":"deep-spaces-other-shore-1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/deep-spaces-other-shore-1-1","image":null,"number":1,"seriesId":"deep-spaces-other-shore","firstEpisodeUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/deep-spaces-other-shore-1-1","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:37:22.679Z","episodeCount":26,"minEpisodeFound":1,"maxEpisodeFound":26,"missingEpisodes":[],"paginationComplete":true,"initialSyncComplete":true}],"episodes":[{"id":"deep-spaces-other-shore-1-1","slug":"deep-spaces-other-shore-1-1","title":"Deep Space's Other Shore — Cap. 1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/deep-spaces-other-shore-1-1","servers":[],"previousUrl":null,"nextUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/deep-spaces-other-shore-1-2","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T2